  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "32463334",
      "title": "A Standalone Root Component",
      "lectureOrder": 669,
      "videoOrder": 615,
      "sourceHash": "7b4f678321a3ed89de8236bdfb3e6374a3283db165f93d042751d22979112b66",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.07,
          "end": 5.04,
          "en": "-: Now that we also migrated the welcome.component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.04,
          "end": 7.89,
          "en": "it's time to finally migrate the app.component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.89,
          "end": 10.98,
          "en": "as well though, because this will then also allow us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.98,
          "end": 13.8,
          "en": "to get rid of this entire app.module.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.8,
          "end": 16.2,
          "en": "So therefore, we should go to the app.component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.2,
          "end": 20.133,
          "en": "and there also add standalone and set this to true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.42,
          "end": 24.18,
          "en": "Now, in there I want to use the app welcome",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.18,
          "end": 25.8,
          "en": "or the welcome.component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.8,
          "end": 27.63,
          "en": "So therefore, we should add imports",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.63,
          "end": 31.41,
          "en": "as you learned it and import the welcome.component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.41,
          "end": 34.143,
          "en": "and also add an import to the file here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.67,
          "end": 37.29,
          "en": "Now with that, it will fail though",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.29,
          "end": 38.91,
          "en": "because the app.component is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.91,
          "end": 40.773,
          "en": "of course an important component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.61,
          "end": 45.09,
          "en": "Yes, we would have to remove it from app declarations",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.09,
          "end": 48.18,
          "en": "but if I now add app.component here to imports",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.18,
          "end": 50.64,
          "en": "it will still fail because, as mentioned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 50.64,
          "end": 52.5,
          "en": "it is a key component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.5,
          "end": 54.24,
          "en": "It's the root component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 54.24,
          "end": 57.45,
          "en": "If we want to migrate the root component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 57.45,
          "end": 60.706,
          "en": "of our application and turn it into a standalone component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 60.706,
          "end": 65.37,
          "en": "we also have to change our bootstrapping code in main.ts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 65.37,
          "end": 67.98,
          "en": "Instead of bootstrapping with a module,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 67.98,
          "end": 70.28999999999999,
          "en": "we now wanna bootstrap a component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 70.28999999999999,
          "end": 74.28,
          "en": "and just a component, because we just have a component now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 74.28,
          "end": 76.56,
          "en": "We don't have a module anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 76.56,
          "end": 79.65,
          "en": "I mean, we have one here, but we don't need it anymore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 79.65,
          "end": 82.08,
          "en": "because the root component is standalone.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 82.08,
          "end": 84.96000000000001,
          "en": "And the idea behind standalone components is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 84.96000000000001,
          "end": 89.55,
          "en": "that they work without modules. Therefore, in main.ts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 89.55,
          "end": 93.50999999999999,
          "en": "we now bootstrap the application; not with this code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 93.50999999999999,
          "end": 94.8,
          "en": "we can get rid of that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 94.8,
          "end": 99.8,
          "en": "Therefore, instead we call a bootstrap application function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 99.93,
          "end": 104.643,
          "en": "which is imported from @angular/platform-browser.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 105.69,
          "end": 109.036,
          "en": "We import that. We import this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 109.036,
          "end": 112.08,
          "en": "and two bootstrap application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 112.08,
          "end": 115.2,
          "en": "we pass a pointer at our root component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 115.2,
          "end": 120.03,
          "en": "So in this case, app.component. I'm importing app.component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 120.03,
          "end": 123.48,
          "en": "from app/app.component, and I'm pointing at it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 123.48,
          "end": 125.16,
          "en": "I'm passing this pointer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 125.16,
          "end": 128.823,
          "en": "at this clause to the bootstrap application function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 129.75,
          "end": 133.89,
          "en": "And with this, if we save that, our application works again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 133.89,
          "end": 137.4,
          "en": "I also get no error here. The service still works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 137.4,
          "end": 139.38,
          "en": "The directive obviously still works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 139.38,
          "end": 142.95,
          "en": "And now we migrated everything to standalone components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 142.95,
          "end": 146.55,
          "en": "including the root component, which now must be bootstrapped",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 146.55,
          "end": 149.206,
          "en": "with help of this function, which takes that single",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 149.206,
          "end": 153.51,
          "en": "standalone component, instead of an entire module.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 153.51,
          "end": 157.07999999999998,
          "en": "This also means that we can get rid of app.module now-",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 157.07999999999998,
          "end": 161.07,
          "en": "of this entire file, because this browser module,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 161.07,
          "end": 163.29,
          "en": "which was imported, is made available",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 163.29,
          "end": 166.07999999999998,
          "en": "by Bootstrap application anyways.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 166.07999999999998,
          "end": 168.48,
          "en": "It's made available by default, so we don't",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 168.48,
          "end": 170.22,
          "en": "need to take care about that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 170.22,
          "end": 173.1,
          "en": "And other than that, we only had imports here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 173.1,
          "end": 175.43200000000002,
          "en": "and we don't need that anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 175.43200000000002,
          "end": 178.38,
          "en": "So now we can get rid of app module,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 178.38,
          "end": 180.69,
          "en": "and that was our goal in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 180.69,
          "end": 183.48,
          "en": "And that is the biggest benefit we can get",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 183.48,
          "end": 186.12,
          "en": "out of standalone components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 186.12,
          "end": 188.7,
          "en": "Because now I got rid of both modules,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 188.7,
          "end": 191.82,
          "en": "which I had in this application at the beginning,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 191.82,
          "end": 195.84,
          "en": "and we therefore now have less boilerplate and learner code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 195.84,
          "end": 199.25,
          "en": "And if I save this, the app of course still works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 199.25,
          "end": 200.13,
          "en": "Now, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 200.13,
          "end": 204.27,
          "en": "we did have to add all these standalone flags",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 204.27,
          "end": 208.14,
          "en": "and these imports properties, but it is possible that maybe",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 208.14,
          "end": 211.82999999999998,
          "en": "in some future standalone components will be the default",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 211.82999999999998,
          "end": 214.599,
          "en": "and therefore this flag doesn't have to be added anymore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 214.599,
          "end": 218.28,
          "en": "because in the future, maybe true is the default here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 218.28,
          "end": 220.62,
          "en": "and hence this can be omitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 220.62,
          "end": 222.87,
          "en": "But right now, that's not the case yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 222.87,
          "end": 226.2,
          "en": "But then we would have less boilerplate code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 226.2,
          "end": 228.75,
          "en": "And regarding imports, chances are",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 228.75,
          "end": 231,
          "en": "that this is never going to disappear.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 231,
          "end": 234.06,
          "en": "But of course, it's still less code to write",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 234.06,
          "end": 238.17000000000002,
          "en": "and less boilerplate than you have with all those modules",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 238.17000000000002,
          "end": 240.39,
          "en": "especially in bigger applications where",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 240.39,
          "end": 243.72,
          "en": "your modules can get very complex.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 243.72,
          "end": 246.12,
          "en": "So this is now this app migrated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 246.12,
          "end": 249.57,
          "en": "to standalone components and standalone directives.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 249.57,
          "end": 251.76,
          "en": "As a next step, let's take a closer look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 251.76,
          "end": 254.85,
          "en": "at services with standalone components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 254.85,
          "end": 258.063,
          "en": "before we then take a look at routing and lazy loading.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
